    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_01",
      "hash64": "04DCA3FBE2124FD0",
      "text": "나는 위험해...!\\n가까이 오지 않는 게 좋다고...!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_02",
      "hash64": "04DCA6FBE21254E9",
      "text": "나를 내버려 둬...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_03",
      "hash64": "04DCA5FBE2125336",
      "text": "......",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_04",
      "hash64": "04DCA8FBE212584F",
      "text": "설마 너도...\\n나와 같은... 존재인 건가...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_05",
      "hash64": "04DCA7FBE212569C",
      "text": "역시 너도...\\n『소리』가 들리는 거야...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_06",
      "hash64": "04DCAAFBE2125BB5",
      "text": "그렇군...\\n너는 무엇의 인도를 받은 거지...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_01",
      "hash64": "2C3001979E4B352C",
      "text": "빛...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_02",
      "hash64": "2C3004979E4B3A45",
      "text": "바람...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_03",
      "hash64": "2C3003979E4B3892",
      "text": "어둠...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_04",
      "hash64": "2C2FFE979E4B3013",
      "text": "무언가...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_05",
      "hash64": "2C2FFD979E4B2E60",
      "text": "모르겠어",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_07",
      "hash64": "04DCA9FBE2125A02",
      "text": "빛이라... 음...\\n빛은 좀... 아닌 것 같네...!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_08",
      "hash64": "04DCACFBE2125F1B",
      "text": "응? 바람!?\\n그것도 괜찮아 보이는데...!\\r\\n그렇구나... 좋은 울림이다...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_09",
      "hash64": "04DCABFBE2125D68",
      "text": "어둠... 역시 어둠은 좋다니까...\\n칠흑 같은 영혼이 나를 더 갈증나게 해...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_10",
      "hash64": "04D93EFBE20F6E5A",
      "text": "무언가...는 좋지 않은데...\\n좀 더 생각해 보라고...!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_11",
      "hash64": "04D93FFBE20F700D",
      "text": "너도... 날뛰려고 하지 않아?\\n그쪽 손이 말이야...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_06",
      "hash64": "2C3000979E4B3379",
      "text": "오른손?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_07",
      "hash64": "2C2FFF979E4B31C6",
      "text": "왼손?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_12",
      "hash64": "04D93CFBE20F6AF4",
      "text": "오른손...? 이거 미안하게 됐군...\\n아무래도 내가 오해를 한 모양이야...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_13",
      "hash64": "04D93DFBE20F6CA7",
      "text": "그래! 왼손이야...!\\n역시 너는... 동지였어...!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_14",
      "hash64": "04D93AFBE20F678E",
      "text": "너는 내 동지니까\\n이 황혼의 인을 전수해 주겠어.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
